```ts
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  return bookmarks.filter((b) => tags.every((t) => b.tags.includes(t)));
}
```

- **AND semantics**: `tags.every(...)` requires each bookmark to contain *every* tag in `tags`.
- **Empty `tags`**: `every` on an empty array is `true`, so all bookmarks pass through unchanged — no special case needed.

